        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Tapestry woven in wool and silk on a woollen warp, San Michele Tapestry Factory, Italy, 1730-1769"@en , "Tapestry woven in wool and silk on a woollen warp, and about 24 warp threads to 1 inch. Saint John is shown as a young man wearing a green coat with a red cape. He is writing in a book and there is an eagle on the right. The background behind the Saint is pale brown and there is a plain yellow border round the panel."@en ;
